        <mxCell id="J6-yTUkTOqgBHPR-0g9B-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Query Performance Concepts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="280" x="480" y="-100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tFI6YMELiXjWCIeAhTML-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="430" width="590" x="140" y="370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tFI6YMELiXjWCIeAhTML-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Warehouse Performance&amp;nbsp; Concepts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="250" x="300" y="340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tFI6YMELiXjWCIeAhTML-3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="560" x="890" y="360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tFI6YMELiXjWCIeAhTML-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Storage Performance&amp;nbsp; Concepts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="250" x="1060" y="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tFI6YMELiXjWCIeAhTML-5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;u&gt;Basics&lt;/u&gt;:&lt;div&gt;1. Only for DQL, DML, Loading WH is needed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Attached SSD - cache the data from storage&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. alter warehouse &amp;lt;wh_name&amp;gt; suspend | resume;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;(3 states: started, suspended, resizing)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. auto_suspend=3600 (secs), initially_suspended=true, auto_resume=true&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. Credits/hour (charged based of secs, min is 60 secs)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="550" x="140" y="370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tFI6YMELiXjWCIeAhTML-6" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;u&gt;Size up (Vertical Scaling):&lt;/u&gt;&lt;div&gt;Increasing the size (xs to l)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;When there are long running queries&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Manual - how to size up?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;ex: spilling to remote disk - when to size up ?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Removes cache while downsizing&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="260" x="140" y="470" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tFI6YMELiXjWCIeAhTML-7" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;u&gt;Size Out (Horizontal Scaling):&lt;/u&gt;&lt;div&gt;Adding more cluster to the nodes (from 1 to 4)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;When there are concurrent users, queries, // sed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Auto_scale_mode: standard | economy&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;min_cluster_count, max&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="265" x="460" y="470" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tFI6YMELiXjWCIeAhTML-8" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;u&gt;Standard&lt;/u&gt;:&lt;div&gt;start: Immediately add(queued)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;stop: 2min (when determined it can be allocated to other)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="65" width="180" x="410" y="555" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tFI6YMELiXjWCIeAhTML-9" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;u&gt;Economy&lt;/u&gt;:&lt;div&gt;start: 5-6 mins(queued)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;stop: 5-6 mins&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="140" x="585" y="550" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tFI6YMELiXjWCIeAhTML-10" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;u&gt;Generation&lt;/u&gt;: in 2025&lt;div&gt;generation = &#39;2&#39; | &#39;1&#39;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="210" x="140" y="570" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tFI6YMELiXjWCIeAhTML-11" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;u&gt;Query Accelaration Service (QAS):&lt;/u&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. only can be set at the warehouse level&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. It adds serverless nodes to boost query perf.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Only works for the sql that can be parallelised. (agg, bytes scanned)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. system function: system$estimate_query_acceleration(&#39;queryid&#39;) will provide details of eligibility.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. account_usage (schema).query_history(table). query_acceleration_bytes_scanned (col) &amp;gt; 0 to check if it works after enabling&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="380" x="140" y="640" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tFI6YMELiXjWCIeAhTML-12" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;u&gt;ML workloads: &lt;/u&gt;warehouse_type=&#39;snowpark-optimized&#39;&lt;div&gt;Snowpark optimized warehouse&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="300" x="140" y="610" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tFI6YMELiXjWCIeAhTML-13" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;1. pre-sort data before loading&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="200" x="890" y="360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qokGzbmoty0-aevOQxfI-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;u&gt;Metadata Cache: Services Layer (SL)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;div&gt;Stores all DB, table, min, max, count of rows, no_of_partitions&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="270" x="570" y="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qokGzbmoty0-aevOQxfI-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;u&gt;Results Cache: SL&lt;/u&gt;&lt;div&gt;Stores the query results for 24 hours.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Same query 2. Uderlying table no data change&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Same Role&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Alter account set use_cached_result = true_&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="270" x="570" y="145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qokGzbmoty0-aevOQxfI-3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;u&gt;Local disk/Warehouse Cache: WL&lt;/u&gt;&lt;div&gt;Stores the raw micropartitions from the results.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Finite (bigger size, bigger cache)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;recently used query micropartitions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;purged - suspended, resized, dropped&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;partially used (scan only the needed partitions)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="260" x="305" y="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qokGzbmoty0-aevOQxfI-5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Caching&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="100" x="300" y="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qokGzbmoty0-aevOQxfI-6" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Poorly written SQL&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. History tab(UI) (14 days)&amp;nbsp; 2. snowflake.account_usage.query_history(45 mins latency, 365 days) | table(information_schema.query_history()) (7 days)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;Query Profile:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;operator(TableScan, Filter, sort, WindowFunction) (Gives a Tree view)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Stats: partitions_total, scanned, bytes_scanned, %scanned from cache&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Profile Overview: localdiskI/O, RemotediskI/O, Initialization, Synchronization&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Explain plan for&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="450" x="310" y="-50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qokGzbmoty0-aevOQxfI-9" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Search Optimization:&lt;div&gt;alter table &amp;lt;&amp;gt; add | drop search op:&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="220" x="1560" y="-150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qokGzbmoty0-aevOQxfI-8" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;Clustering:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;div&gt;overlapping_micropartitions (clustering metadata)&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;clustering_depth&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;system$clustering_information(&#39;table&#39;,&#39;(col1,col3)&#39;), clustering_depth, automatic_clustering_history&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;clustering key:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;not high or low cardinality columns&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;max of 3 or 4 is recommended&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;better for tables that &amp;gt; 1 TB&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;better on the columns that will be used in where, sort&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;cluster by (month(c1), substring(c2, 0, 10)),&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;ͼv&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;ALTER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ͼv&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;TABLE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; sales RESUME RECLUSTER;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="420" x="850" y="-60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tFI6YMELiXjWCIeAhTML-14" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you can&#39;t do | Limitations?:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Data Partitioning&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Compression&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Encryption&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Since snowflake is a managed service&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="260" x="900" y="390" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FijZIYicbyVRRZhz_-F7-2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="55" width="320" x="862" y="151.25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FijZIYicbyVRRZhz_-F7-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Alter table &amp;lt;tab_name&amp;gt; Add | Drop Search optimization&lt;div&gt;It fasts the = searches &amp;amp; in , works by adding a path&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Background process creates search access path&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="42.5" width="340" x="872" y="157.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="30B-lSc8H3UPZSepPW_R-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="460" x="780" y="500" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="30B-lSc8H3UPZSepPW_R-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="How can you save money ? (Optimize warehouse)&lt;div&gt;1. auto_suspend = true (warehouse being the biggest cost)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. size out, up of the warehouse&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. scaling policy of the warehouse = economy | standard&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. data loading warehouse being small&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. Resource monitor (credit quota, start_at, frequency case when 50 notify, suspend,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; suspend_immediate)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6. purge=true after copying into table from stage&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;7. credits - VW, cloud services- (4.4/hour, 10% daily if less no charge), serverless,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;currency - Storage - bytes/day avg, monthly, Data Transfer- unload, region change&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;8.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;snowflake.billing.focus_Cost_uage&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Account_usage, information_Schema,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="710" x="780" y="510" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
