        <mxCell id="mnWqI2OcNRHywK7y5KrW-11" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="6. Metadata" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="20" width="250" x="-85" y="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mnWqI2OcNRHywK7y5KrW-13" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Auth - username&amp;amp;password, What kind of control you have&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;IM - Creates VirtualWarehouse &amp;amp; s3 blob storage&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Optimizer - Parses query and action plan for VW&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Trans M - ACID compliance, not eventually consistent syste&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Security - encryption &amp;amp; Key rotation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Metadata - Have data about the stored objects, Imp for Performance&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
