        <mxCell id="KQNHkEISXYy6nG-JTSCP-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="1. row based (not file based)&lt;div&gt;2. Kafka&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Channel 1, 2, 3 (Acts like a consumer) (Guarantees order, exact once) -- Offset tokens- stores it&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. high throughput (10gb/sec/table) - matters 1 channel or more (order only within channel)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. Low latency (5 secs, Data for Query within 2 secs)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
