        <mxCell id="yj5OSKJaKRSzJU-mj-Qt-1" parent="uVVWAvPQtGkLIFrdVWl8-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Let&#39;s say I create a object with a custom role &#39;developer&#39; in snowfalke&lt;br/&gt;Other than developer role&lt;br/&gt;Who else will have access to that object ?&lt;br&gt;Typically Developer role will be granted to sysadmin" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="310" x="-150" y="35" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="yj5OSKJaKRSzJU-mj-Qt-2" parent="uVVWAvPQtGkLIFrdVWl8-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&quot;Yes. In an enterprise setup, users authenticate through Okta using SAML SSO, and group membership in Okta can be mapped to Snowflake roles." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="320" x="-160" y="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="yj5OSKJaKRSzJU-mj-Qt-4" parent="uVVWAvPQtGkLIFrdVWl8-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div&gt;Privilege:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Modify, monitor, usage, ownership, select, insert&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4 levels -&amp;gt; 1.Global 2.Account 3.Schemas 4.SchObjects&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Grant, Revoke&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;ex: Grant usage on database &amp;lt;my_db&amp;gt; to role &amp;lt;my_role&amp;gt;:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Future Grant:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Grant select on future tables in schema &amp;lt;my&amp;gt; to &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;my_role&amp;gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="330" x="-495" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="yj5OSKJaKRSzJU-mj-Qt-5" parent="uVVWAvPQtGkLIFrdVWl8-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;1. RBAC (Role Based Access Control) - Important 2.Discretionary Access Control (DAC) 3.User based Access Control (Not recom)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;RBAC:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Users, Roles, Privilege&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Privilege is assigned to --&amp;gt; Roles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Role is assigned to --&amp;gt; Users&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="320" x="-490" y="-70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
