        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xH8zVFUOP_UvEhF3oEc6-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;DBT Basics:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Cloud vs Core&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Macros, Models, Snapshot, Seeds&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Why DBT?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;i). Orchestration, Lineage, Tests, SCD2 and SCD1 implementation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. yaml files, Jinja language&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. Why pre_hook instead of bronze ? -&amp;gt; Copy into from stage, not from a table&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6. generate_schema_name.sql -&amp;gt; without this macro public_silver&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6. Diff types of config in dbt -&amp;gt; materialized: table | incremental&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;7. What are the things you&#39;d define in model yaml file ?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;i) sources (you&#39;d use this in silver because you cannot use ref (pre_hook)) refer point 5&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;8. What are the things you&#39;d define in dbt_project.yaml file ?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;default materialized, vars w.r.t bronze&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="370" x="-405" y="-100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xH8zVFUOP_UvEhF3oEc6-3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="125" width="400" x="11" y="-83" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xH8zVFUOP_UvEhF3oEc6-5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;DBT Commands:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;1.&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(28, 26, 25);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;dbt run-operation walmart_copy_into_snowflake --args &#39;{&quot;table_name&quot;:&quot;department&quot;}&#39; to run macros/pre_hook with arguments.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(28, 26, 25);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(28, 26, 25); font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;dbt run --select transform_stores&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(28, 26, 25); font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(28, 26, 25); font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;dbt snapshot --select snap_walmart_fact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(28, 26, 25); font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;4. dbt build&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(28, 26, 25); font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
